      "id": "claim_5f37c6f3fd0d4b7daf65acc42b1cb6c1",
      "statement": "The coding-agent middleware is ordered outer to inner from ConversationOffloadingMiddleware and PrepareAgentRunMiddleware through tool validation, limits, error/retry and push/PR policy layers, before-model hooks and completion hooks, optional model routing/fallback/dynamic tools, message sanitization and stable ordering, to ModelErrorMiddleware and innermost ModelCallTimeoutMiddleware.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/server.py#L1639-L1724",
